InListModuleDoc
    Version: 1
    Language: en
    Format: STF
    Purpose: Membership test of a value in a list. A CFG-analysis and variable-collection utility.
    Provides: InList(lst, val) -> found. Returns 1 if val is present in lst, otherwise 0.
    DependsOn: none (leaf; Core.ListGet/ListLen/Eq/Or).
    Composition: Native include from modules/GenWasm/GenWasm.sir (Path: ../InList/InList.sir).
    Notes: used by CollectVars/VarsMinus (variable deduplication), Reaches (seen-set cycle guard), NextInOrder (already-emitted block check).
